WEBVTT

00:00:00.625 --> 00:00:02.127
Previously on Love Live!

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:05.839
U's was finally ready to take on
the Love Live preliminaries

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:09.801
when we ran into A-RISE,
the previous winner, in Akiba.

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:10.844
Nice to meet you.

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:14.139
We decided to put on a joint
concert with A-RISE, but...

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:15.849
Compared to an A-RISE concert...

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:17.434
We don't...

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:18.602
...Stand a chance.

00:00:18.602 --> 00:00:19.853
It's not true!

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:22.564
We're performing with those amazing people.

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:25.108
Let's give it our best, too.

00:00:25.108 --> 00:00:29.362
And so, we sang our hearts out
at our preliminary concert!

00:00:31.281 --> 00:00:33.074
I-It's time.

00:00:33.074 --> 00:00:34.743
I'm so nervous.

00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:38.413
My heart's gonna jump out of my chest.

00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:40.665
Is it over? Is it over!?

00:00:40.665 --> 00:00:41.708
Not yet.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.668
Someone answer me!

00:00:43.668 --> 00:00:45.378
You can't hear like that.

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:47.088
Y-Y-Y-Yeah.

00:00:47.088 --> 00:00:50.675
Why are you so nervous a-about
the first round of preliminaries?

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.012
Well, according to the cards...

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:55.096
According to the cards?

00:00:57.015 --> 00:01:00.769
- Actually, I don't wanna know!
- They're up!

00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:06.191
The first group moving on to the
final preliminary round is A-RISE.

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:08.568
The second group is East Heart.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.277
Who else?

00:01:09.277 --> 00:01:11.655
The third group is...Mi...

00:01:11.988 --> 00:01:12.614
Mi?

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:14.658
Midnight Cats.

00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:17.911
Who else?

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:19.621
The fourth group is...

00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:21.790
Mu...

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:24.125
Mu...

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:26.711
Mu...

00:01:26.711 --> 00:01:28.672
Mutant Girls.

00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:34.010
N-N-No...

00:01:34.344 --> 00:01:36.930
No way!

00:01:37.305 --> 00:01:39.057
And that's the dream I had!

00:01:41.351 --> 00:01:42.102
Huh?

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:44.062
It was a dream!?

00:01:44.062 --> 00:01:50.276
Saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:57.867
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:02:04.916 --> 00:02:10.296
Tsuyoi tsuyoi negaigoto ga
A strong, strong wish

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:15.802
bokutachi wo michibiite kureta
Led us along

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:20.890
tsugi wa zettai yuzurenaiyo
We can't give up the next one

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:26.020
nokosareta jikan wo nigirishimete We'll hold
on tightly to the time we have remaining

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:31.526
tada no omoide sore dake ja iyadayo
We don't want only a memory

00:02:31.526 --> 00:02:37.407
seiippai chikara no kagiri hashirunda
We'll run as hard as we can

00:02:37.407 --> 00:02:40.243
(CHANCE FOR ME CHANCE FOR YOU)
(Chance for me! Chance for you!)

00:02:40.243 --> 00:02:45.832
Saa yume wo dakishimetara ue wo muite
Come on... Embrace your dreams and look up

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:50.628
kimi no sekai ga ohkiku kawaruyo
Your world will change dramatically

00:02:50.628 --> 00:02:56.801
saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:02:56.801 --> 00:03:01.848
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:07.145
Ima koko de deaeta kiseki
The miracle that we met here and now

00:03:07.145 --> 00:03:13.860
wasurenaide bokutachi no kisetsu
Don't forget our season

00:03:15.612 --> 00:03:18.573
Either way...it was a vivid dream.

00:03:18.573 --> 00:03:19.866
"Best Idol in the Universe"
Seriously...

00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:24.287
Actually, we're in that situation right now!

00:03:24.287 --> 00:03:26.664
H-How is it the same situation?

00:03:26.664 --> 00:03:28.875
Is it over? Is it over?

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:31.127
Well, according to the cards...

00:03:31.127 --> 00:03:35.131
Don't! At this rate, my dream will come true!

00:03:35.131 --> 00:03:38.009
I know! Nico-chan, try chugging that!

00:03:38.009 --> 00:03:38.843
Why!?

00:03:38.843 --> 00:03:41.971
If we don't change something,
my dream will come true.

00:03:41.971 --> 00:03:43.473
They're up!

00:03:43.473 --> 00:03:48.186
The first group moving on to the
final preliminary round is A-RISE.

00:03:48.186 --> 00:03:50.730
The second group is East Heart.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:54.150
The third group is Midnight Cats.

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:56.569
No. It's all the same.

00:03:57.445 --> 00:03:58.905
The fourth group is...

00:03:58.905 --> 00:03:59.864
Mi...

00:03:59.864 --> 00:04:01.074
Mi?

00:04:01.074 --> 00:04:03.034
Mu!

00:04:03.451 --> 00:04:05.453
Mu!

00:04:05.453 --> 00:04:06.120
Muse.

00:04:06.955 --> 00:04:07.497
What?

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:09.999
M's.

00:04:09.999 --> 00:04:14.420
Otonokizaka High's School Idol group, (J's!

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:18.007
M's? That's us, right?

00:04:18.007 --> 00:04:19.676
Not the hair mousse, right?

00:04:19.676 --> 00:04:20.593
Of course it's us!

00:04:20.593 --> 00:04:22.762
Did we pass?

00:04:22.762 --> 00:04:24.430
We made it through the
regional preliminaries...?

00:04:30.895 --> 00:04:33.189
Yayyy!

00:04:35.567 --> 00:04:36.901
We did it!

00:04:36.901 --> 00:04:38.486
Mama!

00:04:38.486 --> 00:04:39.988
We passed!

00:04:40.321 --> 00:04:42.949
Is it over? Is it over?

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.285
We have an announcement.

00:04:45.285 --> 00:04:48.788
We just received news that u's,
our school idol group,

00:04:48.788 --> 00:04:52.542
made it through the Love Live preliminaries.

00:04:53.167 --> 00:04:54.669
I repeat,

00:04:54.669 --> 00:04:57.881
we just received news that u's,
our school idol group,

00:04:57.881 --> 00:05:01.634
made it through the Love Live preliminaries.

00:05:03.386 --> 00:05:05.555
The final round of preliminaries
will take place in December.

00:05:05.972 --> 00:05:10.059
The one group moving on to
Love Live will be decided then.

00:05:10.059 --> 00:05:13.062
If we win the next one,
we'll advance to Love Live.

00:05:13.062 --> 00:05:16.149
But we have to beat A-RISE...

00:05:16.149 --> 00:05:18.276
Thinking about it now won't do us any good.

00:05:18.276 --> 00:05:19.569
Let's just do our best!

00:05:19.903 --> 00:05:21.487
That's right.

00:05:21.487 --> 00:05:26.284
That's why I'd like to begin our morning
practices an hour earlier starting next week.

00:05:26.284 --> 00:05:28.828
I don't know if I can wake up that early...

00:05:28.828 --> 00:05:32.081
We'll also practice our
fundamentals on Sundays.

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:37.503
Practice doesn't lie,
but we can't just train blindly.

00:05:38.087 --> 00:05:44.969
Making the most out of focused, high-quality
practice is the key to advancing to Love Live.

00:05:46.387 --> 00:05:48.848
All right! Come on, girls!

00:05:48.848 --> 00:05:49.557
“_

00:05:49.557 --> 00:05:51.017
- Wait!
- Huh?

00:05:51.809 --> 00:05:54.646
It feels like someone's missing.

00:05:54.646 --> 00:05:57.482
Me, Kotori-chan, Maki-chan...

00:05:57.941 --> 00:06:00.693
Eli-chi, Umi-chan, Rin-chan...

00:06:00.693 --> 00:06:02.946
Hanayo-chan, Honoka-chan...

00:06:02.946 --> 00:06:04.572
Everyone's here.

00:06:04.572 --> 00:06:05.531
Great!

00:06:05.531 --> 00:06:07.659
Now, let's try this again!

00:06:11.788 --> 00:06:12.997
Nico-chan!

00:06:13.915 --> 00:06:15.750
Nico-chan!

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:17.210
Where are you going?

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:19.170
Don't shout at me!

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:21.923
What's wrong? Practice has already started.

00:06:22.966 --> 00:06:25.969
I-I'm busy today.

00:06:25.969 --> 00:06:28.554
Anyway, the final preliminaries
are approaching.

00:06:28.554 --> 00:06:30.640
You'd better practice hard.

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:31.641
Okay!

00:06:32.016 --> 00:06:34.852
Huh? She left...

00:06:47.782 --> 00:06:49.575
She went inside the store.

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:51.077
Why are we following her?

00:06:51.077 --> 00:06:52.620
'Cuz she's being suspicious.

00:06:53.246 --> 00:06:56.124
Don't tell me she works here.

00:06:56.541 --> 00:06:58.501
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:06:58.501 --> 00:07:02.714
Today's Niku Niko Sale is two
packs of meat for 2,525 yen!

00:07:02.964 --> 00:07:04.716
She's a perfect fit!

00:07:04.716 --> 00:07:07.301
Wait, that's not what it looks like.

00:07:08.469 --> 00:07:10.972
It looks like she's doing normal shopping.

00:07:10.972 --> 00:07:14.475
She's just buying ingredients for dinner.

00:07:14.475 --> 00:07:17.437
But, would she skip practice just for that?

00:07:17.437 --> 00:07:21.899
Since we made it to the next stage
of Love Live, she should be excited.

00:07:21.899 --> 00:07:25.111
Maybe someone really
important is coming over...

00:07:25.111 --> 00:07:29.907
Or maybe there's someone
she really wants to cook for...

00:07:29.907 --> 00:07:31.868
C-Could it be?

00:07:31.868 --> 00:07:33.286
That Nico-chan!?

00:07:33.286 --> 00:07:37.206
No! An idol must never do that!

00:07:37.665 --> 00:07:39.417
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:07:39.417 --> 00:07:41.002
M's member Yazawa Nico!

00:07:41.002 --> 00:07:44.672
Whose apartment is she
skipping practice to frequent?

00:07:44.672 --> 00:07:46.716
How scandalous!

00:07:55.641 --> 00:07:56.517
She's running!

00:07:56.517 --> 00:07:58.352
Why are they following me!?

00:08:03.316 --> 00:08:04.150
Huh?

00:08:08.237 --> 00:08:11.866
I knew you would take the rear exit.

00:08:14.327 --> 00:08:17.246
Tell us what you're up to.

00:08:18.581 --> 00:08:19.707
Hey!

00:08:28.674 --> 00:08:29.592
Huh?

00:08:37.058 --> 00:08:39.769
N-Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:08:41.521 --> 00:08:43.272
Wait!

00:08:53.074 --> 00:08:54.367
Where's Nico-chan?

00:09:00.456 --> 00:09:03.501
I never agreed to this!

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:06.254
Jeez! Nico-chan!

00:09:08.756 --> 00:09:10.716
She's not here.

00:09:13.219 --> 00:09:15.721
She got away in the end.

00:09:16.389 --> 00:09:20.768
I wonder why she was so
desperate to escape...

00:09:21.102 --> 00:09:25.273
Nico-chan's too stubborn to talk to anyone.

00:09:25.273 --> 00:09:27.358
You're one to talk.

00:09:27.358 --> 00:09:28.192
Shut up!

00:09:28.192 --> 00:09:30.111
Should we go to her house?

00:09:30.111 --> 00:09:31.571
You're going to intrude on her?

00:09:31.571 --> 00:09:35.199
She won't talk to us otherwise.

00:09:35.199 --> 00:09:38.995
But, we don't even know where she lives.

00:09:38.995 --> 00:09:40.454
Oh, right.

00:09:41.664 --> 00:09:43.082
What's wrong?

00:09:43.082 --> 00:09:44.000
That...

00:09:48.254 --> 00:09:49.797
Nico-chan!?

00:09:49.797 --> 00:09:52.175
But doesn't she seem a little small?

00:09:52.175 --> 00:09:53.050
Yeah.

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:57.763
Not at all' Nico-chan's pretty
small for a third yea...

00:09:57.763 --> 00:09:59.974
She is small!

00:09:59.974 --> 00:10:02.310
Um... Can I help you?

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:04.061
Uh, no...

00:10:04.061 --> 00:10:09.108
Oh? Aren't you all members of p's?

00:10:09.108 --> 00:10:10.943
What? You know us?

00:10:10.943 --> 00:10:11.569
Yes.

00:10:12.028 --> 00:10:15.239
Thank you for looking after my sister.

00:10:15.239 --> 00:10:18.367
I'm her younger sister, Yazawa Cocoro.

00:10:18.367 --> 00:10:20.494
What!?

00:10:22.205 --> 00:10:23.623
Love Live!

00:10:24.624 --> 00:10:27.543
I never would've guessed
Nico-cchi had a sister...

00:10:27.543 --> 00:10:29.295
And she's so polite.

00:10:29.295 --> 00:10:31.422
They're complete opposites.

00:10:31.422 --> 00:10:33.758
Um, Cocoro-chan...

00:10:33.758 --> 00:10:37.762
- Why do we have to hide—
- Quiet!

00:10:37.762 --> 00:10:39.597
No one's here.

00:10:39.597 --> 00:10:41.515
What about over there?

00:10:41.515 --> 00:10:43.351
I don't see anyone.

00:10:43.351 --> 00:10:46.229
Look carefully. We're up against pros.

00:10:46.229 --> 00:10:48.648
There's no telling where they're hiding.

00:10:48.648 --> 00:10:49.565
Pros!?

00:10:51.651 --> 00:10:52.985
It seems safe.

00:10:53.486 --> 00:10:56.280
Get ready to run when I tell you to go.

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:57.114
Why?

00:10:57.114 --> 00:10:58.407
Isn't it obvious?

00:10:58.824 --> 00:11:00.034
Let's go!

00:11:01.369 --> 00:11:03.371
W-Wait!

00:11:06.666 --> 00:11:09.543
It looks like we're all right.

00:11:09.543 --> 00:11:11.379
What's going on?

00:11:11.379 --> 00:11:15.091
Is Nico-chan the target of an assassin?

00:11:15.091 --> 00:11:16.342
What are you talking about?

00:11:16.342 --> 00:11:18.344
It's the media, of course.

00:11:18.344 --> 00:11:18.886
What?

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:20.888
The paparazzi.

00:11:20.888 --> 00:11:25.643
They know what you backup dancers
look like, so you have to be careful.

00:11:25.643 --> 00:11:28.562
Please tell me before you come over.

00:11:28.562 --> 00:11:29.605
Backup...

00:11:29.605 --> 00:11:30.731
...Dancers?

00:11:30.731 --> 00:11:31.607
Who is?

00:11:31.607 --> 00:11:35.861
Super Idol Yazawa Nico's
backup dancers, J's.

00:11:35.861 --> 00:11:37.655
- What!?
- I've heard all about you.

00:11:37.655 --> 00:11:42.368
Under my sister's tutelage, you're
all currently trying to become idols.

00:11:44.161 --> 00:11:45.329
I see.

00:11:45.329 --> 00:11:47.290
I'm starting to understand the situation.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:50.918
I forgot. We're dealing with Nico-chan.

00:11:50.918 --> 00:11:52.628
Please do your best.

00:11:52.628 --> 00:11:58.342
Despite being failures, the eight of you
together might somehow be able to debut.

00:11:58.342 --> 00:12:00.428
That's what my sister said.

00:12:00.428 --> 00:12:02.263
Who are you calling failures?

00:12:02.263 --> 00:12:03.973
Please don't make that face.

00:12:04.348 --> 00:12:06.976
Learn from my super idol sister.

00:12:07.476 --> 00:12:11.105
It's always Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:12:13.107 --> 00:12:15.276
All together, now.

00:12:15.276 --> 00:12:18.446
- Nico-Nico-Ni!
- Listen, Cocoro-chan.

00:12:18.446 --> 00:12:18.988
Yes?

00:12:18.988 --> 00:12:21.699
Do you mind if I call her?

00:12:21.699 --> 00:12:23.159
Sure!

00:12:25.036 --> 00:12:26.871
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:12:27.246 --> 00:12:28.914
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:12:29.165 --> 00:12:30.916
- Nico-Nico-Ni!
- Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:12:30.916 --> 00:12:32.835
I'll make your heartbeat throb for Nico love!

00:12:32.835 --> 00:12:36.547
This is Yazawa Nico. I can't
answer the phone right now.

00:12:36.547 --> 00:12:38.966
Please leave a message after the tone.

00:12:38.966 --> 00:12:40.926
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:48.351
Hello? This is your backup dancer, Ayase Eli.

00:12:48.351 --> 00:12:51.354
If you're listening, pick up the phone!

00:12:51.354 --> 00:12:54.648
- Pick up your phone, Nico-chan!
- Why are we your backup dancers?

00:12:54.648 --> 00:12:57.151
Explain yourself!

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:05.117
This is Nico-chan's house...

00:13:05.743 --> 00:13:07.370
This is our younger brother, Cotaro.

00:13:07.995 --> 00:13:10.164
Backup dancers.

00:13:12.917 --> 00:13:14.001
Hello.

00:13:14.001 --> 00:13:19.965
Our sister typically stays at the waterfront
apartment provided by her agency,

00:13:19.965 --> 00:13:22.093
but she comes here at night.

00:13:22.093 --> 00:13:23.844
Waterfront? Where?

00:13:24.387 --> 00:13:25.888
That's a secret, of course.

00:13:25.888 --> 00:13:28.557
We can't have the media finding her.

00:13:29.809 --> 00:13:32.561
I wonder why they believe her...

00:13:32.561 --> 00:13:39.068
If she's seen pictures or videos of y's, she'd
immediately know we're not backup dancers.

00:13:39.068 --> 00:13:44.448
Cotaro-kun, have you ever
seen your sister singing?

00:13:44.448 --> 00:13:45.658
That.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:50.162
It's a u's poster.

00:13:50.162 --> 00:13:52.289
No, something's not right.

00:13:52.289 --> 00:13:52.998
Huh?

00:13:55.709 --> 00:13:57.545
She modified it!?

00:14:01.132 --> 00:14:03.801
Is this Nico-chan's room?

00:14:05.261 --> 00:14:08.055
She switched her face with mine.

00:14:08.055 --> 00:14:09.682
It's the same over here.

00:14:10.391 --> 00:14:12.518
Why is she doing all of this?

00:14:12.518 --> 00:14:14.812
It's sorta sad...

00:14:17.815 --> 00:14:19.358
You guys...

00:14:20.317 --> 00:14:21.902
Nico-chan.

00:14:21.902 --> 00:14:24.029
Welcome home, sister.

00:14:24.029 --> 00:14:28.284
Your backup dancers wanted to talk to you.

00:14:28.284 --> 00:14:30.369
R-Really?

00:14:30.369 --> 00:14:32.204
I'm sorry.

00:14:32.204 --> 00:14:34.999
We'll make it quick. Is that all right?

00:14:36.542 --> 00:14:38.419
Uh, um...

00:14:40.838 --> 00:14:47.052
Cocoro, sorry, b-but I need to go
to my apartment for work today.

00:14:47.845 --> 00:14:48.429
Bye.

00:14:48.762 --> 00:14:49.388
She's running!

00:14:50.514 --> 00:14:52.141
Wait!

00:14:52.141 --> 00:14:54.602
Why do I have to keep running!?

00:14:58.689 --> 00:15:00.149
Sis!

00:15:00.149 --> 00:15:01.233
<i>Cocoa!</i>

00:15:03.027 --> 00:15:05.446
Why are you in such a hurry?

00:15:05.446 --> 00:15:06.655
Oh, you know...

00:15:07.031 --> 00:15:09.366
There's another sister!

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:15.247
I'm so sorry.

00:15:15.664 --> 00:15:18.918
I, Yazawa Nico, have been lying.

00:15:18.918 --> 00:15:21.295
Get up and explain yourself.

00:15:27.051 --> 00:15:30.888
C-Come on, girls. You all look so scary.

00:15:30.888 --> 00:15:33.182
It's important for idols to smile.

00:15:33.182 --> 00:15:35.643
All together, everyone.

00:15:35.643 --> 00:15:38.395
- Nico-Nico-Ni—
- Nico-cchi...

00:15:38.395 --> 00:15:40.940
Are you sure you should be playing around?

00:15:43.317 --> 00:15:44.151
Right.

00:15:45.861 --> 00:15:46.862
A business trip?

00:15:47.738 --> 00:15:54.537
Yeah. I have to look after
my siblings for two weeks.

00:15:54.537 --> 00:15:56.830
That's why you skipped practice.

00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:58.958
You should have told us.

00:15:58.958 --> 00:16:03.254
And why do they think we're
your backup dancers?

00:16:03.254 --> 00:16:06.507
Exactly. If there's any problem, it's that.

00:16:06.507 --> 00:16:08.008
B-Because...

00:16:08.008 --> 00:16:09.677
"Because"?

00:16:11.095 --> 00:16:12.930
- Nico-Ni—
- Don't do that.

00:16:13.847 --> 00:16:16.100
Tell us.

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:17.101
Nico-chan.

00:16:20.604 --> 00:16:21.981
It's always been that way.

00:16:21.981 --> 00:16:23.315
Always?

00:16:23.315 --> 00:16:27.486
That's how it's always been at my house.

00:16:27.486 --> 00:16:31.490
I can say whatever I want at home.

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:32.950
But...

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:35.744
Please leave.

00:16:36.912 --> 00:16:38.289
Nico-chan.

00:16:50.759 --> 00:16:52.177
What are we going to do with her?

00:16:52.177 --> 00:16:55.264
I wonder what she meant by
"it's always been that way"...

00:16:55.264 --> 00:16:59.018
Has Nico-chan's family always
thought we were backup dancers?

00:17:00.561 --> 00:17:01.562
Nozomi?

00:17:01.562 --> 00:17:05.733
It probably means she's
always been a super idol.

00:17:05.733 --> 00:17:06.984
What do you mean?

00:17:06.984 --> 00:17:13.032
Remember how I told you Nico-cchi
was a school idol as a first year?

00:17:13.616 --> 00:17:20.205
Maybe that's when she told her
siblings that she became an idol...

00:17:20.205 --> 00:17:24.835
But when it fell through,
she couldn't tell them.

00:17:25.502 --> 00:17:31.091
In that house, Nico-cchi's been
a super idol since her first year.

00:17:31.091 --> 00:17:34.094
That seems likely.

00:17:34.094 --> 00:17:37.348
Just how much pride does Nico-chan have?

00:17:37.348 --> 00:17:39.141
She's just like you.

00:17:39.141 --> 00:17:40.434
Don't make fun of me.

00:17:40.434 --> 00:17:43.520
I wonder if it's just a matter of pride...

00:17:44.271 --> 00:17:47.691
Maybe she really wanted to be an idol...

00:17:48.108 --> 00:17:50.736
She wanted to keep being one.

00:17:50.736 --> 00:17:55.699
I understand, because I've
always wanted to be one, too.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:03.874
I saw her during my first year.

00:18:05.501 --> 00:18:11.340
I was on the student council, and
wasn't interested in idols at the time.

00:18:20.391 --> 00:18:22.101
Club Resignation

00:18:38.575 --> 00:18:41.578
If I had spoken to her then...

00:18:51.296 --> 00:18:52.256
That's it!

00:18:58.137 --> 00:19:00.681
Backup dancers...

00:19:31.044 --> 00:19:32.254
Nico-chan.

00:19:33.714 --> 00:19:35.883
I told you I can't practice—

00:19:36.467 --> 00:19:37.718
Sister.

00:19:37.718 --> 00:19:38.719
Sis.

00:19:38.719 --> 00:19:40.137
School.

00:19:40.721 --> 00:19:42.473
Why did you bring them!?

00:19:42.473 --> 00:19:47.311
Because they said they
wanted to see you perform!

00:19:47.311 --> 00:19:49.396
P-Perform?

00:19:53.984 --> 00:19:55.235
Is this...?

00:19:55.235 --> 00:19:59.239
Nozomi and I came up with
the perfect outfit for you.

00:20:00.282 --> 00:20:03.452
You look great in cute clothes,

00:20:05.037 --> 00:20:07.289
Super Idol Nico-chan.

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:09.124
Nozomi...

00:20:12.419 --> 00:20:19.092
Beyond that door, your biggest fans
are awaiting your solo concert.

00:20:20.093 --> 00:20:21.178
Eli...

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:25.432
Come on, everyone's waiting.

00:20:32.731 --> 00:20:35.776
This is where our sister performs?

00:20:35.776 --> 00:20:37.277
No one's here.

00:20:37.277 --> 00:20:38.946
Roof.

00:20:46.662 --> 00:20:47.913
Idol...

00:20:50.165 --> 00:20:52.668
Cocoro, Cocoa, Cotaro...

00:20:53.252 --> 00:20:55.546
I want to tell you something before I sing.

00:20:55.546 --> 00:20:56.129
What?

00:20:57.172 --> 00:20:58.257
The truth is...

00:21:01.009 --> 00:21:04.346
...this is my last day as a super idol.

00:21:04.346 --> 00:21:05.472
What!?

00:21:05.973 --> 00:21:07.808
You're quitting?

00:21:07.808 --> 00:21:10.143
No, I'm not quitting.

00:21:10.686 --> 00:21:15.440
From now on, I'm going to be
an idol with the members of \'s.

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:18.694
But they're not idols yet, they're just...

00:21:18.694 --> 00:21:20.487
...Backup dancers.

00:21:21.572 --> 00:21:23.323
That's what I thought.

00:21:23.323 --> 00:21:24.825
But I was wrong.

00:21:24.825 --> 00:21:29.246
I want to become a new person from now on.

00:21:29.246 --> 00:21:33.083
I shine brightest when the
nine of us are together.

00:21:33.083 --> 00:21:36.795
Far more than when I was alone.

00:21:36.795 --> 00:21:41.967
As the best idol in the
universe, my dream is to

00:21:42.384 --> 00:21:48.223
shine even brighter with p's,
the best idol unit in the universe.

00:21:49.182 --> 00:21:52.060
That is my biggest dream.

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:53.979
It's what I want to do!

00:21:56.106 --> 00:21:57.900
Sister...

00:21:57.900 --> 00:22:02.571
That's why this is my last solo.

00:22:10.537 --> 00:22:15.000
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:20.839
Ureshiikara kimi ni ai ni ikou
Because I'm happy, I'll go see you

00:22:20.839 --> 00:22:26.553
samishiikara kimi ni ai ni ikou (ai ni ikuyo)
Because I'm lonely, I'll go see you (I'll go see you)

00:22:26.970 --> 00:22:29.806
Sonna kimochi ni narunda
That's how I feel

00:22:29.806 --> 00:22:32.809
susumu toki nayamu toki Whether I'm
making progress or hung up on something,

00:22:32.809 --> 00:22:36.813
tsunagatteirundane zutto
We're always connected

00:22:38.315 --> 00:22:43.946
<i>honki no yume de (HI LETS GO) asu wo tsukamu (HI GO GO) With
a true dream, (Hi! Let's go') seize tomorrow (Hi' Go, go')</i>

00:22:43.946 --> 00:22:51.411
Kitto dekiruyo kimi nara
I'm sure you can do it

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:59.670
tama ni wa yukkuri kimi no pehsu de
Sometimes, take your time at your own pace

00:22:59.670 --> 00:23:05.509
yaritai kototachi mitsumetegoran
To look at all the things you want to do

00:23:05.509 --> 00:23:12.557
sono ato ganbare zenryokudene (ganbarouyo) Then do
your best! With all your strength (Let's do our best)

00:23:12.557 --> 00:23:21.608
Kibun ga harete ohzora e maiagaruyo Once you've
cleared your head, you'll fly up into the sky

00:23:22.150 --> 00:23:32.536
donna toki datte kimi wo mitsumeteru
I'm always looking at you

00:23:35.789 --> 00:23:39.126
Next time on Love Live!
"A New Me"
